r response."}],"noNewGrammarReason":"Lexical-focus Lesson using familiar present be."},"pedagogyVersion":2},"pilot":false,"audioRequired":true,"humanEnglishAuditRequired":true,"dialogueRuntime":"guided_exchange","qualityStage":"model_reviewed_for_testing"}')
